{
  "activity": "NApplicationCard",
  "package": "UiPath.UIAutomation.Activities",
  "coded": [
    {
      "special": "scope",
      "call": "uiAutomation.Open",
      "usings": [
        "UiPath.UIAutomationNext.API.Models",
        "UiPath.UIAutomationNext.Enums"
      ],
      "args": {
        "targetApp": "{TargetApp}",
        "targetAppOptions": {
          "new": "TargetAppOptions",
          "set": {
            "Timeout": "{Timeout}",
            "InteractionMode": "{InteractionMode|enum}",
            "AttachMode": "{AttachMode|enum}",
            "OpenMode": "{OpenMode|enum}",
            "CloseMode": "{CloseMode|enum}",
            "WindowResize": "{WindowResize|enum}",
            "UserDataFolderMode": "{UserDataFolderMode|enum}",
            "UserDataFolderPath": "{UserDataFolderPath}",
            "IsIncognito": "{IsIncognito}",
            "WebDriverMode": "{WebDriverMode|enum}",
            "DialogHandlingOptions": "{DialogHandling}",
            "HealingAgentBehavior": "UiPath.UIAutomationNext.Enums.NChildHealingAgentBehavior.{HealingAgentBehavior}"
          }
        }
      }
    }
  ],
  "ignore": [
    "ScopeGuid",
    "Version"
  ],
  "notes": "using (var app = uiAutomation.Open(TargetAppModel, TargetAppOptions)) { body } にする。中のアクティビティは {app}.Click(...) のように呼ぶ。CloseMode は Dispose で効く。HealingAgentBehavior は型が違う（NHealingAgentBehavior → NChildHealingAgentBehavior）のでメンバー名で写す。InUiElement / OutUiElement（UiElement で開く・返す）、TargetApp.WorkingDirectory はまだ扱わない"
}
